# Fast English Podcast — production secrets/tuning environment template.
#
# This file documents VARIABLE NAMES ONLY. The real file lives on the server at
#   /opt/fast-english/shared/secrets/pocketbase.env
# owned by root:root with mode 0600, and is NEVER committed to Git.
#
# Mandatory (set before `install.sh` / `configure.sh` can run):
# FEP_SUPERUSER_EMAIL=admin@example.com
# FEP_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD=change-me-32-chars-min
#
# REQUIRED-SECRET — settings encryption: random 32-char string.
# The PocketBase image FAILS CLOSED without it (settings — incl. any
# SMTP/S3 credentials — are otherwise stored in plaintext inside pb_data
# and therefore inside every backup ZIP). Must match the Coolify app env
# PB_ENCRYPTION_KEY exactly; rotate both together and re-run
# deploy/configure.sh after rotating.
# PB_ENCRYPTION_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Optional — SMTP. Leave unset for the honest disabled state
# (smtp.enabled=false; no transactional email in production until approved).
# FEP_SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
# FEP_SMTP_PORT=587
# FEP_SMTP_USERNAME=...
# FEP_SMTP_PASSWORD=...
# FEP_SMTP_TLS=true
#
# Optional — S3-compatible backup bucket (only when approved).
# Uses the dedicated backups bucket; never the file-storage bucket.
# FEP_BACKUP_S3_ENABLED=true
# FEP_BACKUP_S3_BUCKET=fast-english-backups
# FEP_BACKUP_S3_REGION=us-east-1
# FEP_BACKUP_S3_ENDPOINT=https://s3.example.com
# FEP_BACKUP_S3_ACCESS_KEY=...
# FEP_BACKUP_S3_SECRET_KEY=...
# FEP_BACKUP_S3_FORCE_PATH_STYLE=true
#
# Optional — production smoke tests (dedicated disposable accounts only).
# smoke-prod.sh generates its own disposable Student accounts; only the
# Staff account used by the payment-review smoke is configured here (must
# be an active, verified staff_admins account created through
# `pnpm staff:bootstrap`).
# FEP_SMOKE_STAFF_EMAIL=staff@example.com
# FEP_SMOKE_STAFF_PASSWORD=...
#
# Staff bootstrap + legacy diagnostic (values stay OUTSIDE Git):
# FEP_PB_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8090
# FEP_PB_SUPERUSER_EMAIL=...
# FEP_PB_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD=...
# FEP_STAFF_EMAIL=...
# FEP_STAFF_PASSWORD=...
# FEP_STAFF_DISPLAY_NAME=...
#
# Never put real customer data or other secrets in this file beyond the
# variables above. Rotate any leaked value immediately.

# ===========================================================================
# Coolify-era integration (see docs/COOLIFY_DEPLOYMENT.md). NAMES ONLY —
# real values live in the GitHub Environment "production" secrets (and in
# the Coolify dashboard for the PocketBase app env), never in the repo.
#
# GitHub Environment secrets (release-deploy.yml / rollback-deploy.yml):
#   COOLIFY_BASE_URL              e.g. https://app.coolify.io (Coolify Cloud)
#   COOLIFY_API_TOKEN             deploy-scoped Coolify API token (rotate; MFA)
#   COOLIFY_APP_UUID_LANDING      Coolify Application UUID (Landing)
#   COOLIFY_APP_UUID_APP          Coolify Application UUID (Student App)
#   COOLIFY_APP_UUID_ADMIN        Coolify Application UUID (Admin Console)
#   COOLIFY_APP_UUID_POCKETBASE   Coolify Application UUID (PocketBase)
#   GHCR_PUBLISH_TOKEN            optional dedicated GHCR publish token
#   FEP_SSH_HOST / FEP_SSH_USER / FEP_SSH_KEY / FEP_SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS
#                                 operator SSH access for the PRE-DEPLOY
#                                 BACKUP step only (TYPE B/C releases);
#                                 FEP_SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS = the ssh-keyscan
#                                 host-key line (pins the host key —
#                                 never trust-on-first-use); normal
#                                 frontend releases need NO SSH
#   FEP_SMOKE_STAFF_EMAIL / FEP_SMOKE_STAFF_PASSWORD
#                                 dedicated disposable Staff account for
#                                 smoke-prod.sh --full (mirror of the
#                                 server secrets file values)
#   FEP_SUPERUSER_EMAIL / FEP_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD
#                                 mirror of the server secrets file values
#                                 (smoke entitlement fixtures)
#
# Coolify Application env (PocketBase app; encrypted at rest in Coolify):
#   PB_ENCRYPTION_KEY             MUST match the server secrets file value
#
# Host paths (production VPS; owned by the fixed backend UID/GID 10001):
#   /opt/fast-english/shared/pb_data      PB bind mount (never deleted)
#   /opt/fast-english/shared/backups      verified backup copies
#   /opt/fast-english/shared/releases     public APK + release metadata
#   /opt/fast-english/shared/secrets      operator secrets file (root 0600)
